  decl_variadic_err_overload.pcpp - break step of decl_variadic.pcpp:
  a cpplink variadic routine that shares its name with another routine

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\decl_variadic_err_overload.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\decl_variadic_err_overload.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
